  "project": "https://hub.docker.com/r/ossapps/splitpro/",
  "description": "Open source alternative to Splitwise About SplitPro aims to provide an open-source way to share expenses with your friends. It's meant to be a complete replacement for Splitwise. It currently has most of the important features. - Add expenses with an individual or groups - Overall balances across the groups - Multiple currency support - Upload expense bills - PWA support - Split expense unequally (share, percentage, exact amounts, adjustments) - Push notification - Download your data - Import from splitwise More features coming every day For Docker Configuration Read https://github.com/swiss01/Unraid-templates/blob/main/splitpro/README.md",
